        "text": "Global IPL Device Sales",
        "text1": "No. 1",
        "des": "Source: Frost&Sullivan, confirmed based on research on global hair removal device market and calculated by 2023 global sales volume metrics. Hair removal device refers to a beauty instrument that targets hair follicles using technologies such as laser and intense pulsed light (IPL), with the aim of reducing or removing hair. The survey was completed in October 2024.",
